        "id": 19880,
        "name": "Sea-Envy",
        "username": "Sea-Envy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/sea-envy/{size}/1849_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-04-23T22:28:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I use a screen name and avatar because it's memorable not because I need to hide my identity</p>\n<p>I was one of the 25 Legendary backers that got to be an NPC in the game</p>\n<p>I was not pay attention my first play through but...</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I am in the tutorial bank mission!!!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I am the guy in the green shirt and brown pants cowering next to a hatchback, the closest civilian to the hero start point!&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Thank you Cory Heald</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>My middle inital is N. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; C.N.V. = Sea_Envy</p>\n<p>if the rest of you want to share feel free to follow up</p>\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:53:44.483Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 2,
