        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I use a screen name and avatar because it's memorable not because I need to hide my identity</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I was one of the 25 Legendary backers that got to be an NPC in the game</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I was not pay attention my first play through but...</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I am in the tutorial bank mission!!!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I am the guy in the green shirt and brown pants cowering next to a hatchback,<u> the closest civilian to the hero start point!&nbsp;</u></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thank you Cory Heald</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>My middle inital is N. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; C.N.V. = Sea_Envy</p>\r\n\r\n<p>if the rest of you want to share feel free to follow up</p>\r\n\r\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>",
